{"ticker":"MOS","updated":"2026-11-14T01:14:15Z","profile":{"longName":"The Mosaic Company","shortName":"Mosaic Company (The)","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Agricultural Inputs","country":"United States","website":"https://www.mosaicco.com","fullTimeEmployees":13249,"marketCap":6968448000,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":15.655577,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.5857611,"pegRatio":2.31,"targetMeanPrice":25.16111,"targetHighPrice":34.0,"targetLowPrice":18.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":18,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.102,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.07633,"operatingMargins":-0.00204,"profitMargins":-0.09431,"totalRevenue":11896399872,"beta":0.858,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":32.25,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":16.99,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.04},"summary":"The Mosaic Company, through its subsidiaries, produces and markets concentrated phosphate and potash crop nutrients. It operates in three segments: Phosphates, Potash, and Mosaic Fertilizantes. The company owns and operates mines and production facilities, which produce concentrated phosphate crop nutrients and phosphate-based animal feed ingredients, as well as concentrated phosphate crop nutrients, such as diammonium phosphate, monoammonium phosphate, and MicroEssentials, a value-added ammoniated phosphate product. It also mines, processes, and sells potash to crop nutrient manufacturers, distributors, retailers, and to customers for industrial use; and owns and operates mines, chemical plants, crop nutrient blending and bagging facilities, port terminals and warehouses, which produce and sell concentrated phosphate and potash-based crop nutrients, and phosphate-based animal feed ingredients. In addition, the company produces a double sulfate of potash magnesia product under the K-Mag brand; and purchases phosphate, potash, and nitrogen products to produce blended crop nutrients. Further, it offers triple superphosphate, single superphosphate, and dicalcium phosphate; feed phosphate under the Biofos and Nexfos brands; potash for de-icing and as a water softener regenerant; and phosphogypsum. The company sells its products to wholesale distributors, retail chains, cooperatives","summary_zh":"馬賽克公司透過其子公司生產和銷售濃縮磷酸鹽和鉀肥作物營養素。它的業務分為三個部分：磷酸鹽、鉀鹽和馬賽克肥料。該公司擁有並經營礦山和生產設施，生產濃縮磷酸鹽作物營養素和磷酸鹽動物飼料成分，以及濃縮磷酸鹽作物營養素，如磷酸二銨、磷酸一銨和加值氨化磷酸鹽產品MicroEssentials。它還開採、加工鉀肥，並將其銷售給作物養分製造商、分銷商、零售商以及工業用途的客戶；擁有並經營礦山、化工廠、作物養分混合和裝袋設施、港口碼頭和倉庫，生產和銷售濃縮磷酸鹽和鉀基作物養分以及磷酸鹽動物飼料成分。此外，該公司還生產K-Mag品牌的雙硫酸鉀鎂產品；並購買磷酸鹽、鉀肥和氮產品來生產混合作物營養素。此外，還提供重過磷酸鈣、單過磷酸鈣和磷酸二鈣； Biofos 和 Nexfos 品牌的飼料磷酸鹽；用於除冰和作為軟水劑再生劑的鉀肥；和磷石膏。該公司將產品銷售給批發經銷商、零售連鎖店、合作社","sector_zh":"基礎材料","industry_zh":"農業投入","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":33.72,"h":34.59,"l":33.55,"c":34.05,"v":4556400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":34.01,"h":34.24,"l":33.45,"c":33.82,"v":3834500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":34.05,"h":34.51,"l":33.82,"c":34.16,"v":3969800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":34.02,"h":34.36,"l":33.43,"c":34.22,"v":3572900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":34.15,"h":34.32,"l":33.86,"c":33.98,"v":4302200},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":33.86,"h":33.88,"l":33.25,"c":33.43,"v":3230500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":33.67,"h":34.12,"l":33.42,"c":33.97,"v":2864300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":34.17,"h":36.03,"l":34.05,"c":35.93,"v":5158300},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":36.14,"h":36.99,"l":34.2,"c":34.79,"v":9841100},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":34.79,"h":35.52,"l":34.31,"c":35.32,"v":3606400},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":35.31,"h":35.59,"l":34.38,"c":34.7,"v":3427100},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":34.68,"h":34.9,"l":34.44,"c":34.68,"v":3493500},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":34.71,"h":34.81,"l":33.74,"c":33.82,"v":3234100},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":33.96,"h":35.22,"l":33.91,"c":34.76,"v":4140900},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":34.85,"h":35.35,"l":34.43,"c":34.53,"v":2767600},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":34.45,"h":35.62,"l":34.45,"c":35.34,"v":4669500},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":35.51,"h":35.8,"l":34.98,"c":35.41,"v":4018000},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":35.86,"h":36.0,"l":34.26,"c":34.79,"v":4484800},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":34.89,"h":35.18,"l":33.25,"